  "details": "<p>Romulus divided the people into three tribes, naming them, respectively,\u00a0<em>Ramnes</em>\u00a0or\u00a0<em>Ramnenses</em>, the\u00a0<em>Tities</em>\u00a0or\u00a0<em>Titienses</em>, and the\u00a0<em>Luceres</em>\u00a0or\u00a0<em>Lucerenses.</em></p>",
